Vendo CLI — manage your data pipeline from the terminal

Usage: vendo [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Account:
  login             Authenticate with your Vendo account
  logout            Remove stored credentials
  workspace         Show the current account, your profiles and setup checks
  status            Account health overview
  help              Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
  version           Print version
  Profile           Manage account profiles
    profile list    List all configured profiles
    profile switch  Switch to a different profile
    profile set     Set values on the active profile
  mcp               Show how to connect an MCP client (Claude, Cursor, Windsurf)
                    to Vendo
  completions       Generate shell completion script (bash, zsh, fish)
  update            Update the Vendo CLI using the hosted installer

Data pipeline:
  Apps                           Manage apps
    apps list                    List all apps
    apps diagnose                Show apps that need attention
    apps get                     Get app details
    apps pause                   Pause an app
    apps resume                  Resume a paused app
    apps delete                  Delete an app (soft delete)
    apps create                  Create a new app
    apps update                  Update an app
  Sources                        Manage data sources
    sources list                 List all data sources
    sources get                  Get source details
    sources sync                 Trigger a manual sync
    sources pause                Pause a data source
    sources resume               Resume a paused data source
    sources delete               Delete a data source (soft delete)
    sources create               Create a new data source
    sources update               Update a data source
  Destinations                   Manage data export destinations
    destinations list            List all destinations
    destinations get             Get destination details
    destinations sync            Trigger a manual sync
    destinations refresh-source  Check source-data availability for a window and
                                 trigger top-up imports for missing ranges
    destinations pause           Pause a destination
    destinations resume          Resume a paused destination
    destinations delete          Delete a destination (soft delete)
    destinations create          Create a new destination (source → destination
                                 pipeline)
    destinations update          Update a destination
  Jobs                           Monitor sync jobs
    jobs list                    List sync jobs
    jobs get                     Get job details
    jobs cancel                  Cancel a pending or running job
    jobs watch                   Watch running and pending jobs (live polling)
    jobs tail                    Tail a single job or the latest job for a
                                 source/destination

Data catalog:
  Catalog                           Browse available platforms
    catalog list                    List the platforms ready to connect
    catalog get                     Get details for a specific platform
  Dictionary                        Browse the data dictionary catalog
    dictionary list                 List catalog definitions (events by default)
    dictionary search               Search one subject type by text in subject
                                    ID, name and description
    dictionary get                  Look up one catalog definition by the
                                    subject ID from list or search, or an alias
                                    such as event:<name>
  Metrics                           Manage custom metrics in the Metrics Library
    metrics list                    List all custom metrics
    metrics get                     Get metric details
    metrics create                  Create a new metric
    metrics update                  Update a metric
    metrics activate                Activate a draft metric
    metrics delete                  Delete a metric
  Models                            Manage data models
    models list                     List all data models
    models get                      Get model details
  Measurement                       Inspect Marketing Measurement methodologies,
                                    LTV, and signals
    measurement methodologies list  List methodologies (system + account)
    measurement methodologies get   Show one methodology by ID
    measurement rules preview       Preview which segmentation rule fires for
                                    recent rows
    measurement ltv list            List cohort LTV rows
    measurement ltv cohort          Show one cohort by period — retention matrix
                                    + cumulative LTV curve + prediction
    measurement ltv customer        Show one customer's cohort + realised LTV +
                                    revenue timeline
    measurement signals list        Per-signal availability summary
    measurement signals click-path  Click-path signal status — readiness,
                                    last-computed, recent SignalEstimates

Options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile (or set VENDO_PROFILE)
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
  -V, --version         Print version
  -h, --help            Print help

See `vendo <command> --help` for flags and examples.
